# --- merged from the stray workspace-root .gitignore (2026-10-28) ---
# gsync used to append its project patterns to whatever CWD it was launched
# from, which put these four test-output filters in the workspace root. They
# are preserved here rather than deleted; the auto-append now refuses to write
# into a folder that merely holds the platform tools.
test-*.txt
test-out*.txt
*-output.txt
test-final.txt
